,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-01-15T15:27:36Z","updated_at":"2026-01-15T15:28:33Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nv4.5.1.stable.official [f62fdbde1]\nv4.6.rc1.official [481f36ed2]\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.6.rc1 - Windows 10 (build 19045) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - Vulkan (Forward+) - integrated AMD Radeon(TM) Graphics (Advanced Micro Devices, Inc.; 31.0.21923.11000) - AMD Ryzen 5 5600G with Radeon Graphics (12 threads) - 31.29 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nThere are incorrect calculations in `Sprite2D::is_pixel_opaque`, making by pixel selection buggy. Examples from the MRP:\n\nActual sprite pixels|Selectable pixels overlayed in red\n-|-\n<img width=\"745\" height=\"510\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5d87ead8-d374-4b06-8f49-3a6347398eb8\" />|<img width=\"745\" height=\"510\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8137b6f9-223f-4366-bff7-023f5b8c632f\" />\n\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nOpen MRP, try selecting sprites by clicking relevant pixels.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[sprite-2d-by-pixel-selection.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/24646823/sprite-2d-by-pixel-selection.zip)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114991/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114991/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}